    <div class="mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-white text-center mb-12">
        Partner <span class="text-[#FF9C20]">success stories</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#FF9C20]/20 flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="text-3xl">🎥</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-white font-bold">TechGamer</div>
              <div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-sm">YouTube Creator</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-cool-gray-20 mb-4">
            "I've been an affiliate for 6 months and earned over $3,000! The 30% recurring commission is incredible. My audience loves QuackHost."
